<title>USA: ECHELON International Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>ECHELON International Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	1996</p>
<p> Sales and Revenues			 $10.3     $9.7</p>
<p>Net income (loss) before</p>
<p>  extraordinary item			  4.7    (0.8)</p>
