<p>NOTE:  ECHELON International Corp says its net income for the first quarter of 1997 includes $1.4 million realized from the sale and settlement of the company's interest in the lease of an oil rig to Reading and Bates, a $2.5 million after-tax gain, which had been deferred, as a result of the previously reported par-value sale of a loan and an extraordinary loss of ($.8) million, or $0.12 per share, for the early paydown of a loan.</p>
